[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 721.75, "timestamp": "00:12:01", "text": "我可以做好多事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 723.91, "timestamp": "00:12:03", "text": "有人会说：“杰克，你为什么不在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 726.31, "timestamp": "00:12:06", "text": "日本组装一台电脑呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 730.23, "timestamp": "00:12:10", "text": "东京有很多二手电脑店什么的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 732.55, "timestamp": "00:12:12", "text": "，你可以自己组装啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 736.629, "timestamp": "00:12:16", "text": "对吧？” 是的，我也打算这么做。 嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 738.87, "timestamp": "00:12:18", "text": "就像我在想，与其让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 742.389, "timestamp": "00:12:22", "text": "家里的硬件"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 750.23, "timestamp": "00:12:30", "text": "腐烂、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 755.75, "timestamp": "00:12:35", "text": "损坏或磨损，不如把它们重新利用起来，而不是让它们闲置在那里，最终被遗忘或闲置不用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 758.87, "timestamp": "00:12:38", "text": "我可以把它们带到这里，安装、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 762.629, "timestamp": "00:12:42", "text": "维护等等，修补、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 765.59, "timestamp": "00:12:45", "text": "修理，然后用于我的东西。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 775.03, "timestamp": "00:12:55", "text": "。 最近我一直在玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 777.75, "timestamp": "00:12:57", "text": "我已经"}]